config APP_LAB
    bool "Lab: experiments on the hardware"
    depends on BOOT_TRACE && MMC_STM32_SDMMC && SOC_STM32U5
    select FAT_RO
    select FLASH_BLK_NOR
    help
      A system app listing experiments, each run on demand with its
      steps and results on screen: the reset causes and the boot trace
      of the run before, the clocks, the eMMC step by step and through
      its driver, its NOR window, the update drive and the system
      resources on it, what a firmware with its storage on the eMMC left
      there, the battery's chips read raw, and tests of the trace
      itself. It writes to the eMMC only in its GUI region. For the UNA
      Watch's experiments firmware (unawatch/lab).

config APP_LAB_AUTOSTART
    bool "Open the Lab at boot"
    depends on APP_LAB
    default y
    help
      Open the Lab app on its report of the run before at every boot.
